site
====

A personal website.

Requirements
------------

- A CLI Markdown-to-HTML converter (md2html).

Installation
------------

Modify [`config.mk`](./config.mk) as needed.

The following command builds the website in-source and installs the website's
files to `ROOT`.

	$ make install

Structure
---------

The [`assets`][./assets] directory is copied to `ROOT` as is.

The [`src`](./src) directory contains each page's Markdown file.

The [`template`](./template) directory contains files that are used to generate
the full HTML document of each page.
